.mp4?t=1726695655\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use the talent tree. Do you prefer to move noiselessly or run faster? Do you want to learn how to break locks or make smelly traps? The decision is yours!","developers":["Glob Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287380/header.jpg?t=1726695655","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Party Crasher Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 550 Ti / Intel HD 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670K / AMD FX-8320 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 / Radeon R9 290X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":[" Glob Games Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Drogas l\u00edcitas\r\nDrogas il\u00edcitas","rating":"14","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"true"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287380/ss_a1d4874c92de4ebbfd396b284548aea3cd5e9ae0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726695655","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1287380/ss_a1d4874c92de4ebbfd396b284548aea3cd5e9ae0.600x338.